  "brief": {
    "zh": "维修单要求 5 个主电模块和 3 张绝缘贴。只有 2 个主模块通过检验，其余批次已封存。每缺 1 个主模块，改用 2 个合格备用电芯和 1 根连接线。两种方案都要一张通用校验卡，全箱共用 1 张。封存模块和测试电芯都不能装。让 AI 更新旧清单，逐轮核对，确认整箱能完成原任务。",
    "en": "The ticket requests 5 main modules and 3 insulation pads. Only 2 main modules passed inspection. The rest of that batch is sealed. Replace each missing module with 2 certified spare cells and 1 connector lead. Either supply type needs the same check card, so include exactly 1 shared card. Exclude sealed modules and test cells. Update the old manifest with AI and audit each round before approval."
  },
